uto\">Tu respuesta queda guardada correctamente.</p></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><p dir=\"auto\">No es una evaluación de conocimientos ni afecta a tu progreso.</p></li>\n</ul><p dir=\"auto\">Si quieres ampliar tu valoración, puedes dejar tu feedback en comentarios o escribir directamente al TA de tu edición.</p>\n<div id=\"floating-emoji-picker-region\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"detail-layout-attachment-region\"></div>\n<div id=\"course-join-region\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"print-hide\" id=\"detail-layout-more-posts-region\"><div class=\"more-posts-container\"><div class=\"more-posts-title text-color-title\">Explore More Posts</div>\n<div class=\"post-grid-region\"></div>\n<div class=\"next-posts-region\"><div class=\"next-posts-container has-completion-criteria\"><div class=\"quiz-text-container\">\n<div class=\"quiz-text course-navigation-text-title text-color-title\">Ready to take the Quiz?</div>\n<a class=\"start-quiz-button navigate mighty-btn-square-large mighty-btn-centered mighty-btn-filled-theme-color-button\" href=\"#\">Start</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"next-previous-container\">\n<div class=\"previous-post-region phone-hide\"><div class=\"post-left\"><div class=\"coursework-grid-navigation-item\">\n<div class=\"coursework-grid-navigation-item-inner \" rel=\"\" title=\"\">\n<a class=\"navigate\" href=\"https://training.lidr.co/posts/ai-engineering-202604-📄-filtrado-contextual-y-temporal-🔴-18-min\">\n<div class=\"left-icon-container\">\n<div class=\"left-icon icon-chevron-left-16\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"coursework-grid-navigation-item-content\">\n<div class=\"navigator-label\">Previous</div>\n<div class=\"coursework-grid-navigation-item-title text-color-title\">📄 Filtrado contextual y temporal 🔴— 18 min</div>\n<div class=\"coursework-grid-navigation-item-subtitle\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"right-icon-container\">\n<div class=\"right-icon icon-chevron-right-16\"></div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"next-post-region\"><div